<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68834" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόσχος</span></b>  (B), ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>calf, young bull</i>, which form the god Apis was believed
			to assume, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.28
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				78.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				6279.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>: as fem., <i>heifer, young cow</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόσχους ἀμέλγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					389
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ba.</u>
				736
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεζαὶ μ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑταῖραι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				169
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾄδειν ἐπὶ μόσχῳ</span> for
			the prize of a <i>calf</i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ
				Μόσχῳ</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>boy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				1623
			</span></i>: as fem., <i>girl, maid</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				526
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Andr.</u>
				711
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>any young animal</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>IT</u>
				163
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ba.</u>
				1185
			</span></i> (both lyr.); even of birds, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. χελιδόνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Achae.
					47
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. θαλάσσιος</span>”
				<i>seal,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Edict.Diocl.
					8.37
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
